+# PROTOFORM completion criterion
+
+One invocation of the required interpreter must create canonical checkpoint files for every requested epoch/arm/cadence case, invoke the sealed V1 loader, serialize the complete verdict matrix to `matrix.json`, and prove or disprove resume equality by comparing both canonical payload bytes and raw NumPy/Adam state bytes after one deterministic post-resume update.
+
+The harness reads the sealed Stage-C source from `/home/sat/mcrl-v025-stagec4b-snapshot-20260909` (the copy whose arm and epoch checks occur at the user-cited lines 1170 and 1186) and writes only below this directory.

